[[File:Lizardmen icon.png|left]]
'''Lizardmen''' are reptilian humanoids that inhabit the [[Kebos Lowlands]] and within the [[Lizardman Canyon]]. Secretly created from [[Lizard (Quidamortem)|a native species of lizard]] during the 37th decade ''(1,040 years ago)'' under the rule of King Shayzien VII, he had intended the lizardmen to become his personal army to enforce his tyrannical rule of Great Kourend. After he returned from the dead as [[Xeric]], the lizardmen continued to serve him loyally, seeing him as their god. Today, long after his exile, they still remain loyal, constantly attempting to invade Great Kourend.

Lizardmen can be unlocked as a [[Slayer task]] at a cost of 75 [[Slayer reward points]]. Once unlocked, they can be assigned by medium and high-level Slayer masters. The slightly stronger [[lizardman brute]] and even stronger [[lizardman shaman]] also count towards the task. Killing any variant of lizardmen while on a normal [[Lizard#Slayer strategy|Lizard]] task will '''NOT''' progress the task.

Killing a lizardman is a task in the [[medium Kourend & Kebos Diary]].

